stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open
  Open --> Capturing: input/tool_result
  Capturing --> Settled: host ack
  Settled --> Materializing: context
  Materializing --> Settled: view receipt
  Settled --> Preparing: compact
  Preparing --> NativeFallback: soft reject
  Preparing --> Staged: verified PCR
  Staged --> Committed: session_compact ack
  Staged --> Recovering: failure/restart
  Recovering --> Settled
  Open --> Closed: session_shutdown
